  "prefLabel": "Ch 401.01 Continuing education hour",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-08-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ch 401.01 “Continuing education hour” means an hour that includes at least 50 minutes of active instruction and is credited by the board against the continuing education requirements set forth in Ch 404.01(a).\n\nSource. #1488, eff 11-20-79; ss by #2052, eff 6-9-82; ss by #2716, eff 5-17-84; ss by #4671, eff 9-7-89; ss by #5624, eff 5-18-93, EXPIRED: 5-18-99\n\nNew. #8739, eff 10-11-06; ss by #9358, eff 1-10-09, EXPIRED: 1-10-17\n\nNew. #12107, INTERIM, eff 2-21-17, EXPIRED: 8-20-17\n\nNew. #12431, eff 12-8-17",
